  <item>
    <title>S2, Ep 6: Patrick Reed RETURNS To The PGA Tour, Neal Shipley Interview</title>
    <link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSXS_Rg3UHA</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSXS_Rg3UHA</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 22:00:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>Dan on Golf</dc:creator>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;BIG news on today’s show: Patrick Reed is returning to the PGA TOUR. What does that mean for the TOUR? LIV Golf? Will anyone else join him? Alan Shipnuck joins the show to dive into the details and what’s next in this unprecedented time in professional golf. Also, PGA TOUR rookie &amp; friend of the program Neal Shipley joins the show to discuss his rookie season on TOUR, his love for golf courses, being the last (as of now) to play with Tiger at Augusta &amp; much more.

Thank You to Our Sponsors!

Dan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSXS_Rg3UHA"&gt;Watch on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
